    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. self-acceptance feels empty when there's no one to actually witness it. it just feels like i'm waiting for something that's never coming. honestly, sometimes the thought of just... not having to do this anymore... not having to carry this weight of being nothing... it's the only thing that actually brings me any sense of peace. like, if i'm already invisible, does it even matter if i stay or go?",
